l},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-09-30T04:37:31Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T02:58:19Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.2.stable.mono\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable.mono - macOS Unknown (27.0.0) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M5 Pro (Apple9) - Apple M5 Pro (15 threads) - 48.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nA crash occurs when garbage collection runs while accessing the `Count` property of a Godot array.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Apply the MRP code, export the project to iOS, and run it.\n2. A crash occurs approximately 10 seconds after launch.\n\n<img width=\"638\" height=\"182\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d42c4f96-2e7f-4c68-a501-4a1a032a2ccf\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n```\nusing Godot;\nusing System;\nusing System.Threading;\n\nclass Foo\n{\n    public bool Bar;\n\n    public Foo(bool bar)\n    {\n        Bar = bar;\n    }\n}\n\npublic partial class MainScene : Node2D\n{\n    public override void _Ready()\n    {\n        new Thread(() =>\n        {\n            while (true)\n            {\n                GC.Collect();\n            }\n        }).Start();\n\n        new Thread(() =>\n        {\n            while (true)\n            {\n                new Foo(new Godot.Collections.Array { 1 }.Count == 1);\n            }\n        }).Start();\n    }\n}\n```","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124016/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124016/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null}